  "releaseNotes": "Version 9.0.4: Simplified Generator package structure.\n      - Removed manual DLL inclusion targets, using standard NuGet package structure\n      - Generator DLL now automatically included via standard build output\n      - Simplified project configuration for better maintainability\n      Version 9.0.3: Fixed NuGet package structure for Generator.\n      - Added explicit DLL inclusion in analyzers folder for source generator functionality\n      - Added DLL to lib folder so public types (TranslateOptionsAttribute) are available to consumers\n      - Generator DLL now properly included in both analyzers and lib folders\n      Version 9.0.2: Fixed symbol package generation issue for Generator package.\n      - Disabled symbol generation for Generator (source generator, no executable code)\n      - Updated workflow to publish Generator without symbols\n      Version 9.0.1: Fixed symbol package generation issue for meta-package.\n      - Disabled symbol generation for meta-package (no code to debug)\n      - Updated workflow to publish packages separately\n      Version 9.0.0: Initial release of MKS.Translates meta-package.\n      - Includes MKS.Translates.Core runtime library\n      - Includes MKS.Translates.Generator source generator\n      - Easy installation of complete translation system",
